  {
    "name": "propose_project_update",
    "title": "Editar propuesta",
    "kind": "draft",
    "category": "proposals",
    "card": "pending-action",
    "surfaces": [
      "app-assistant",
      "proposal-assistant",
      "mcp"
    ],
    "description": "Prepara cambios en la propuesta abierta. Grupos panels/inverters/batteries requieren [{id del catálogo,count,unitPriceUSD confirmado}]; no inventes precios. customItems/customDiscounts son listas completas con ids y descripción; en customItems conserva hideInQuotation (cobrado pero oculto en la factura) tal como lo devuelve get_project. rates.gridConnection: \"grid_export\" | \"zero_export\" | \"off_grid\". Solo con off_grid, rates.supplyAlternative fija contra qué se compara el ahorro: \"utility_tariff\" (tarifa, por defecto), \"generator\" (requiere rates.generatorCostPerKWh en USD/kWh, > 0; pregúntalo, no lo inventes; null lo borra) o \"no_comparison\" (sin ahorro, payback ni TIR/VAN). rates.netMeteringRegime: \"sie007_2026\" (cargo por kWh inyectado) o \"legacy_retention\" (retención % anterior); cámbialo solo si el usuario lo pide. rates.gridUseChargeDOPPerKWh: cargo por uso de la red en RD$/kWh inyectado (0 a 100), solo en sie007_2026; toma el valor de get_tariffs o del usuario, no lo inventes. Campos: {\"client\":[\"name\",\"company\",\"location\",\"province\",\"address\",\"distributor\",\"tariffCode\",\"quoteValidityDays\",\"quoteDate\",\"contactPerson\",\"contactPhone\",\"contactEmail\",\"nic\",\"nis\",\"rnc\",\"contractNumber\",\"circuit\",\"meterNumber\",\"voltagePhase\"],\"specs\":[\"panels\",\"inverters\",\"batteries\",\"panelPowerW\",\"panelCount\",\"inverterPowerKW\",\"inverterCount\",\"hasBattery\",\"batteryCapacityKWh\",\"batteryCount\",\"batteryCostUSD\",\"installationServicesDesc\",\"dopExchangeRate\",\"saleMarginMultiplier\",\"panelUnitPriceUSD\",\"inverterUnitPriceUSD\",\"batteryUnitPriceUSD\",\"installationUnitPriceUSD\",\"autoSupplierPricing\",\"panelEfficiency\",\"tempCoeff\",\"systemLosses\",\"annualDegradation\",\"batteryDOD\",\"batteryEfficiencyPct\",\"batteryNightLoadSharePct\",\"batteryLifespanYears\",\"batteryReplacementCostUSD\",\"daytimeSelfConsumptionRatio\",\"daytimeLoadRatio\",\"loadProfilePreset\",\"showSelfConsumptionBreakdown\",\"autoCalculatePanels\"],\"rates\":[\"energyCostPerKWh\",\"distributor\",\"targetCoveragePct\",\"tariffCode\",\"currency\",\"usdExchangeRate\",\"gridExportFeePct\",\"isZeroExport\",\"gridConnection\",\"supplyAlternative\",\"generatorCostPerKWh\",\"annualEnergyInflationPct\",\"netMeteringRegime\",\"gridUseChargeDOPPerKWh\"],\"financials\":[\"customItems\",\"customDiscounts\",\"applyLey5707\",\"applyITBISExemption\",\"discountRatePct\",\"projectLifespanYears\",\"co2FactorKgPerKWh\"],\"consumption\":[\"monthlyConsumption\"]}",
    "inputSchema": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 128,
          "description": "ID de la propuesta abierta."
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "string",
          "maxLength": 150,
          "description": "Resumen breve del cambio."
        },
        "edits": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 40,
          "description": "Campos a cambiar. valueJson es el valor serializado en JSON, por ejemplo 95, true, \"Santiago\" o doce consumos.",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "section": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "client",
                  "specs",
                  "rates",
                  "financials",
                  "consumption"
                ]
              },
              "field": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 64
              },
              "valueJson": {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 20000
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "section",
              "field",
              "valueJson"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "edits"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    }
  },
